# .prettierrc.js sets endOfLine: "lf", so LF is the canonical form for every
# text file here. Without this file Git applies its per-platform default on
# checkout: the Windows CI runner materialises CRLF, every file then disagrees
# with the configured line ending, and `npm run format:check` fails with ~393
# files needing formatting. That is exactly what the Windows leg hit when the
# format check was first wired into plugin-test.yml.
#
# Normalising here rather than relaxing endOfLine to "auto" keeps one canonical
# form in the repository, so a Windows contributor cannot commit CRLF that a
# Linux reviewer then sees as a whole-file diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never translate line endings in these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
